WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
- [Kelly] I mean, I love her.

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.760
Like I loved her before we did Hollywide.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.500
Hollywide, what?
- Hollywide!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.770
- We didn't do Hollywide Game Night;

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:07.790
it was Hollywood Game Night,

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:08.760
and it was super fun.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.580
I loved her before then, but I will say,

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.580
before we get to my love
of Peppermint and Alias

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.680
and all things you do,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.383
you've met Meryl.

00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:16.912
How is she?
(audience laughs)

00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:17.745
Is she great?

00:00:17.745 --> 00:00:18.690
Is she great?

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.120
- I mean, I met her brief.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.010
I don't know her.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.480
I'm not, you know...
- But you met her,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.900
and you're like famous,
and you're in movies,

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.990
and she's famous and in movies,

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:25.840
and so you're kinda the same.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.010
- Yeah, we're kinda the same, yeah.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
No, I did a play with Kevin Kline.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.790
We did Cyrano.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.623
- Love him!

00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:35.456
- [Jennifer] Yes.

00:00:35.456 --> 00:00:36.289
- Sophie's Choice.

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:37.270
- Yes. And they were old pals.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.480
And every night,

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.520
he didn't want to know
who was in the audience.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.852
And every night he would say,

00:00:41.852 --> 00:00:43.310
(deep voice)` "I think
I heard Meryl laugh.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.570
Did you hear Meryl?

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:45.403
Meryl's out there."

00:00:45.403 --> 00:00:47.080
And then the night that she came back,

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.252
we were like, "She's here!

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:49.210
You're finally here!"

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.043
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:50.043 --> 00:00:52.910
- But she's, you know, she's a person.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:53.743
- [Kelly] Yeah
(audience laughs)

00:00:53.743 --> 00:00:55.103
No, totally.

00:00:55.103 --> 00:00:55.936
Totally a normal human,

00:00:55.936 --> 00:00:57.060
that's why I think I love her so much,

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:57.893
'cause she doesn't-

00:00:57.893 --> 00:01:00.000
- She seems like she has mom friends.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.500
- Exactly, like normal mom friends.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.333
Yeah, I'm obsessed with her.

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:04.620
I'm obsessed with you, too, though, so-

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.920
- You know what, you know
what I love about you?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:07.753
- What?

00:01:07.753 --> 00:01:08.617
- You have no chill.

00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:11.120
(audience applause and laughter)

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.063
- No I don't.

00:01:13.618 --> 00:01:15.090
(laughing)

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.980
I literally run, like
(trills) all the time.

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:20.383
- You make me seem calm.

00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:21.280
- I know!

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.480
- I feel a very zen vibe

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:25.410
because I have to yin to your yang

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.296
and I feel like it really works.

00:01:26.296 --> 00:01:27.540
- [Kelly] I know.

